/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Independent","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"familiar","description":{"value":"<p>In an encounter, if you don't Command your familiar, it still gains 1 action each round. Typically, you still decide how it spends that action, but, the GM might determine that your familiar chooses its own tactics rather than performing your preferred action. This doesn't work with @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.familiar-abilities.Item.9PsptrEoCC4QdM23]{Valet} or similar abilities that require a command, if you're capable of riding your familiar, or similar situations.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":""},"rules":[],"traits":{"value":[],"otherTags":[]},"slug":"independent","_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.363","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.1.2","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.familiar-abilities.Item.2fiQzoEKu6YUnrU9","createdTime":1780387496893,"modifiedTime":1780387496893,"lastModifiedBy":"Om2THqk3vEFcx1CE","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"_id":"oGvI2gBLAgh7KJXl","ownership":{"default":0}},{"img":"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/bazaar/systems/pf2e/assets/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Manual Dexterity","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"familiar","description":{"value":"<p>It can use up to two of its limbs as if they were hands to perform manipulate actions.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":""},"rules":[],"traits":{"value":[],"otherTags":[]},"slug":"manual-dexterity","_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.363","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.1.2","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.familiar-abilities.Item.cT5octWchU4gjrhP","createdTime":1780387496893,"modifiedTime":1780387496893,"lastModifiedBy":"Om2THqk3vEFcx1CE","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"_id":"lXKXerlbImz92ywA","ownership":{"default":0}},{"img":"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/bazaar/systems/pf2e/assets/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Familiar of Paired Perplexity","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"familiar","description":{"value":"<p>Your familiar has twice as many of a small feature than a normal creature would have, such a second tail or an extra pair of whiskers. When you Cast or Sustain a hex, your familiar seems to double and be in two places at once. One creature you choose within 20 feet of it is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 1} until the start of your next turn; this is a visual effect.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Lost Omens Divine Mysteries","authors":""},"rules":[],"traits":{"value":[],"otherTags":[]},"slug":"familiar-of-paired-perplexity","_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.363","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.1.2","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.familiar-abilities.Item.bhpa7DVdMsaNfodz","createdTime":1780387496893,"modifiedTime":1780387496893,"lastModifiedBy":"Om2THqk3vEFcx1CE","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"_id":"vgCDDUN7FLFgb31D","ownership":{"default":0}},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Item Delivery","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"familiar","description":{"value":"<p>If your familiar is adjacent to you, you can Command it to deliver an item. Instead of its normal 2 actions, your familiar Interacts to take an item you're holding of light Bulk or less, then takes one move action, then finally Interacts to pass off the item to another willing creature.</p>\n<p>It can instead administer the item to the creature if it can do so with 1 action and has an appropriate type of item (such as alchemical elixir). If your familiar doesn't reach the target this turn, it holds the item until commanded otherwise. Your familiar must have the manual dexterity ability to select this.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core 2","authors":""},"rules":[],"traits":{"value":[],"otherTags":[]},"slug":"item-delivery","_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.363","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.1.2","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.familiar-abilities.Item.Ms8EVO2mNbr4Zp1i","createdTime":1780424281822,"modifiedTime":1780424281823,"lastModifiedBy":"ixMNM4YAfpikVzU4","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"ixMNM4YAfpikVzU4":3},"flags":{"scene-packer":{"hash":"f8389a500d9dbff0a5740cafbe752b5a6a8ed076"}},"_id":"X0XUD5ttBC5UyGom"},{"_id":"8xRqEXVfNCraIW0x","img":"icons/sundries/flags/banner-sword-blue.webp","name":"Effect: Commander's Banner","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.8NtRuNYGiU2iTwgL]{Commander's Banner}</p>\n<p>You gain a +1 status bonus to Will saves and DCs against fear effects. If the origin has the Glorious Banner feat, this bonus increases to +2, and you gain a +1 status bonus to AC, Fortitude saves, and Reflex saves.</p>","gm":""},"duration":{"expiry":null,"sustained":false,"unit":"unlimited","value":-1},"fromSpell":false,"level":{"value":1},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Battlecry!","authors":""},"rules":[{"hideIfDisabled":true,"key":"FlatModifier","predicate":["item:trait:fear"],"selector":["ac","fortitude-dc","reflex-dc","will"],"slug":"commanders-banner-fear","type":"status","value":1},{"hideIfDisabled":true,"key":"FlatModifier","predicate":["pa